ClawMemory Pro Commercial License
----------------------------------

The Pro features of ClawMemory (identified by files with `//go:build pro` build tags
or located in the private repository) are NOT covered by the MIT License above.

Pro features include but are not limited to:
- Advanced AI features (conflict scan, wiki generation, memory compression,
  relation discovery, smart routing, decay evaluation)
- Pro decay management (stats, apply, reinforce)
- Pro knowledge graph (auto-graph, evolution insights, discover, infer)
- Pro backup scheduling
- Pro memory compression (preview, apply, config)
- License activation and verification system
- ProGuard anti-tamper system

These features require a valid commercial license key. Without a valid license:
- You may NOT use, modify, or distribute the Pro features
- You may NOT compile the software with the `pro` build tag
- You may NOT bypass, remove, or disable the license verification

To obtain a Pro license, visit: https://github.com/860016/Clawmemory

For licensing inquiries, contact the maintainer.
